From 83821367bae8205e4f033e865966510e69b9ddd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan3DSMods <349040779+Ryan3DSMods@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:31:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] 3DS: size the heaps ourselves (96 MiB app-heap region
 cap)

libctru's automatic split put remaining-minus-linear (98.8 MiB) into the
application heap, which exceeds the 96 MiB OS heap region and made
svcControlMemory fail at startup. Override __system_allocateHeaps: fill
the app heap up to the region cap, give the rest to the linear heap.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LZLN7FDQD6zdxCr63yFAou
